              "text": "### 1. Four S8b Morpeko V-UNION Numbers on Page 40208\nOn official publisher card detail page 40208 (`https://www.pokemon-card.com/card-search/details.php/card/40208`), the four card numbers listed for **Morpeko V-UNION** (ハイクラスパック *VMAXクライマックス* / S8b, illustrated by Yuu Nishida) are:\n* **S8b 226/184** (左上 / Top-Left)\n* **S8b 227/184** (右上 / Top-Right)\n* **S8b 228/184** (左下 / Bottom-Left)\n* **S8b 229/184** (右下 / Bottom-Right)\n\n*(Note: The regular RRR printing in the same set occupies numbers **056/184** through **059/184**, illustrated by Mitsuhiro Arita).*\n\n---\n\n### 2. Release Date of M6a *30th CELEBRATION*\nAccording to the official announcement on `pokemon-card.com`, the Japanese MEGA Expansion Pack **\"30th CELEBRATION\"** (M6a) was released on:\n* **September 16, 2026 (Wednesday)**\n\n---\n\n### 3. Evidence for M6a G/R on Page 50574\n**No.** Page 50574 (`https://www.pokemon-card.com/card-search/details.php/card/50574`) does not provide evidence for an M6a \"G/R\" (or G/RGB) card:\n* Page 50574 documents **Mew** (*ミュウ*) numbered **MF 011/040**, illustrated by Cona Nitanda, from the companion product **30th CELEBRATION プレミアムデッキセット エーフィ・ブラッキー** (*Premium Deck Set Espeon & Umbreon*).\n* It belongs to product set mark **MF** rather than the booster expansion **M6a**, and contains standard card metadata (HP 60, *Psychic / サイコキネシス*) with no rarity coding, text, or numbering pointing to an M6a G/R variant.\n\n---\n\n### Primary Official URLs (`pokemon-card.com`)\n* **Morpeko V-UNION (S8b):** `https://www.pokemon-card.com/card-search/details.php/card/40208`\n* **Mew (MF 011/040):** `https://www.pokemon-card.com/card-search/details.php/card/50574`\n* **30th CELEBRATION Product Announcement:** `https://www.pokemon-card.com/products/`\n\n---\n\n### Remaining Gaps\n1. **Unlisted Secret / RGB Rare Details:** While circulating community leaks and secondary market listings discuss unnumbered/RGB-coded cards (e.g., R/RGB, G/RGB, B/RGB Mew), official `pokemon-card.com` card database records often omit unannounced secret subset designations or do not catalogue them under standard card search numerical queries.\n2. **Expansion cross-references:** The database entry on page 50574 is limited exclusively to the standalone fixed deck product (MF) and does not reference booster expansion (M6a) subsets or alternate print registries.",
